  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK Aid Match due diligence</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity UK Aid Match due diligence is a component of UK Aid Match 2013&#x2013;2016: giving the public a say in how a portion of the aid budget is spent reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;62,725. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Health policy and administrative management, Water sector policy and administrative management, Education policy and administrative management, Agricultural development.</narrative>
  </description>
